# 大 (dai / big) — compact version
# Three strokes: horizontal, vertical, two diagonals
grid 5 9

# vertical stroke
v 4 0 4

# horizontal stroke — row 1
h 1 1 7

# left diagonal (撇) — from just below crossing, sweeping left
d 2 3 4 0

# right diagonal (捺) — from just below crossing, sweeping right
d 2 5 4 8
